autoware-localrepo-1-5-0 (1.5.0-3ubuntu2204) jammy; urgency=medium

  * Stop bundling autoware-data-1-5-0 (1.8 GB of ML models). autoware-full
    now pulls autoware-model-downloader-1-5-0; run
    autoware-download-models-1-5-0 as your own user to fetch the models into
    ~/autoware_data.
  * autoware-theme-1-5-0 1.5.0-2: the theme script is now
    apply-autoware-theme-1-5-0, so other Autoware versions can be installed
    beside this one.
  * uninstall-autoware.sh: --purge also removes config files, the localrepo
    and leftovers under /opt/autoware/1.5.0; -y skips the questions. It
    touches only 1.5.0: other installed versions keep their packages. It now catches
    acados and the model downloader, lists what apt autoremove would take
    before taking it, and lists users' model directories without deleting
    them.

 -- Jerry Lin <jerry73204@gmail.com>  Mon, 02 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0800

